==History ==
2017
*The Hunter [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 12/12/2017, in the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]].
2018
*On 24/1/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/1/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hunter's range to 4 tiles (from 5 tiles) and slightly decreased his bullet spread.
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], fixed a bug where the Hunter could not hit targets on top of him.
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Hunter from Jungle Arena to Goblin Stadium.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
2019
*On 7/10/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/10/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Hunter's damage by 2%.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Hunter's card info screen.
2021
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Hunter's first attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 0.7 seconds).
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Hunter from Goblin Stadium to Hog Mountain.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], decreased the Hunter's first attack time interval to 0.9 seconds (from 1.1 seconds).
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/2/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hunter's first attack time interval to 0.8 seconds (from 0.9 seconds).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 6/8/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Hunter's hitpoints by 5.5%
2025
*On 30/1/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (30/1/2025)|maintenance break]], made it so that damage boost from the [[Rune Giant]] would be split on Hunter instead of being granted to each of his projectiles.
*On 3/3/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/3/2025)|March 2025 Update]], added the Hunter's Evolution.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Hunter's hitpoints by 0.11%.
*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hunter's first attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 0.8 seconds).

